OL,3,ABlood tests find high level of
OL,4,Acancer-causing forever chemical in
OL,5,Aresidents near factory
OL,6,
OL,7,FBlood tests have found "really high
OL,8,Flevels" of a cancer-causing forever
OL,9,Fchemical in dozens of people living
OL,10,Fnear a major chemical factory in the
OL,11,FUK.
OL,13,FThe residents, from Thornton-Cleveleys,
OL,14,FLancashire, have been told they could
OL,15,Fbe at elevated risk of serious health
OL,16,Fconditions from the substance, known as
OL,17,FPFOA.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
