OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABlood tests find high level of
OL,4,Acancer-causing forever chemical in
OL,5,Aresidents near factory
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe village has been under
OL,8,Finvestigation for years by the
OL,9,FEnvironment Agency over contamination
OL,10,Fof soils and locally grown food from
OL,11,Fthe substance, which is a type of
OL,12,Fforever chemical - so-called because
OL,13,Fthey do not easily break down.
OL,15,FThat investigation said high levels
OL,16,Flikely came from the nearby AGC
OL,17,FChemicals factory, which used it to
OL,18,Fmanufacture coating for frying pans
OL,19,Funtil 2012.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/38
