OL,3,AUK military jamming other nations'
OL,4,Asatellites to defend itself, BBC told
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes as the head of the RAF said
OL,7,Fthe UK faced "unprecedented threats"
OL,8,Ffrom adversaries in space, coinciding
OL,9,Fwith the creation of a new RAF unit set
OL,10,Fup to defend Britain's satellites.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
